# Build context for api/Dockerfile, the repository's only image.
#
# The API is built from api/ alone — its own manifest, lockfile and sources —
# so everything else is excluded. This keeps the context at a few hundred KB
# instead of the ~2 GB the repository weighs with node_modules and release
# artefacts in it.
*
!api/

# Host installs and previous local builds must never land in the image: they
# would overwrite what `npm ci` and `tsc` produce inside it, and node_modules
# built on a developer's machine carries the wrong platform's binaries.
api/node_modules/
api/dist/
